{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778975163043,"sessionID":"ses_1ccd342daffel1Vs1vzyOGLdrx","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_fuunm7AecbZNQ7WRhrmHii9J","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+Added the requested non-duplicate synonyms to MONDO:0011323. Changes committed in PR #<NN>.\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+## Summary\n+\n+Updated `MONDO:0011323` (`arhinia, choanal atresia, and microphthalmia`) in response to issue #9882.\n+\n+## Changes\n+\n+- Added exact synonym `Bosma syndrome` with source `NORD:1909`.\n+- Added exact synonym `Gifford-Bosma syndrome` with source `NORD:1909`.\n+- Added exact synonym `Ruprecht Majewski syndrome` with source `NORD:1909`.\n+- Added the issue tracker item `https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9882`.\n+\n+## Rationale\n+\n+The requested synonym list partly overlapped with existing synonym assertions on `MONDO:0011323`; I did not add capitalization-only duplicates of the primary label or synonyms that were already present. The three newly added synonyms are listed in the NORD Bosma Arhinia Microphthalmia Syndrome report, so I used `NORD:1909` as provenance.\n+\n+## Validation\n+\n+- Inspected the existing term stanza with `obo-grep.pl`.\n+- Checked out and checked in the term using `obo-checkout.pl` and `obo-checkin.pl`.\n+- Verified OBO syntax with `robot convert --catalog src/ontology/catalog-v001.xml -i src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo -f obo -o src/ontology/mondo-edit.TMP.obo`.\n+- Attempted required ODK normalization, but `docker` is not installed in this evaluation environment, so `make NORM` could not be run.\n+\n+## Checklist\n+\n+- [x] Read issue context.\n+- [x] Reviewed existing synonyms for duplicates.\n+- [x] Verified synonym source in NORD content.\n+- [x] Added only non-duplicate requested synonyms with source attribution.\n+- [x] Added issue tracker link.\n+- [x] Ran available syntax validation.\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\nA PR_COMMENTS.md","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,1 @@\n+Added the requested non-duplicate synonyms to MONDO:0011323. Changes committed in PR #<NN>.\n\nIndex: /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,30 @@\n+## Summary\n+\n+Updated `MONDO:0011323` (`arhinia, choanal atresia, and microphthalmia`) in response to issue #9882.\n+\n+## Changes\n+\n+- Added exact synonym `Bosma syndrome` with source `NORD:1909`.\n+- Added exact synonym `Gifford-Bosma syndrome` with source `NORD:1909`.\n+- Added exact synonym `Ruprecht Majewski syndrome` with source `NORD:1909`.\n+- Added the issue tracker item `https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9882`.\n+\n+## Rationale\n+\n+The requested synonym list partly overlapped with existing synonym assertions on `MONDO:0011323`; I did not add capitalization-only duplicates of the primary label or synonyms that were already present. The three newly added synonyms are listed in the NORD Bosma Arhinia Microphthalmia Syndrome report, so I used `NORD:1909` as provenance.\n+\n+## Validation\n+\n+- Inspected the existing term stanza with `obo-grep.pl`.\n+- Checked out and checked in the term using `obo-checkout.pl` and `obo-checkin.pl`.\n+- Verified OBO syntax with `robot convert --catalog src/ontology/catalog-v001.xml -i src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo -f obo -o src/ontology/mondo-